  m_text: 'This game was made by a group of students and non-students of the International
    School of Comics of Florence during a Game Jam taken on october 2025, to sensibilize
    about the humanitarian crisis going on during that time.


    We hope the message
    of how much is important to keep on spreading peace and sense of union has touched
    your hearth.


    We thank you again for playing and hope you''re going to make
    a donation.'
